		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"eval", exp="g.no241=1"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030280"},
		line=1107,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"One week after Operation Bellflower is brought to fruition─",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The plaza in front of the Imperial Palace is filled with throngs of people as far as the eye can see.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Kanami─Empress Hisui stands upon the stage facing the crowds.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"She's joined by chairman of the Sworn Blades, Inou Hotori, and interim governor-general, Elsa Valentine.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Kanami proceeds to deliver her address commemorating the peaceful conclusion to the political upheaval the week prior.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am pleased to proclaim that Okonogi Tokihiko, he who abused his authority since assuming the office of chancellor, has been removed from power.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“And furthermore, former Republican Governor-General Warren Valentine has been repatriated to his homeland for his innumerable crimes.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I thereby declare, here and now, this Empire's complete independence from Republican rule.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"The crowd swells up with an outpouring of cheers.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Chants of “Long live Empress Hisui!” rise from the crowd until they pass through the lips of all those present.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Our triumphant declaration of independence today would not have been possible were it not for the extraordinary efforts put forth by one Elsa Valentine-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“We the people owe a tremendous debt of gratitude to one Inou Hotori, as well.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“As Empress, I can offer only my most sincere gratitude to these heroes of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
{"font", size=53},
"“However, their efforts alone would have come to nothing if not for the countless brave warriors and Republican soldiers alike who risked their lives that our Empire might live.”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Kanami lowers her eyes in a display of gratitude.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“All have made truly tremendous sacrifices on our behalf. Particularly Elsa-sama, who went so far as to forsake her Republican nationality in service to the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“She is the true savior of this Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I wish to bestow upon her an honorary citizenship in the hopes that she may forevermore be seated with us at the table of brotherhood.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Inou Hotori and the warriors, too, have endured many unendurable indignities in the time since the war.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yet the fealty burning within their hearts was enough to outlive the menace of tyranny, and they rose up in glorious triumph when we needed them most.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"The audience once again erupts into applause as Kanami lavishes praise upon Elsa and Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"With the Empress's blessing, Elsa has been accepted as an Imperial, and the warriors' honor has been restored.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"There are some people who might be opposed, but the absolute weight of the Empress's words is sure to silence any and all dissenters.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Henceforth, I wish to build a new Empire alongside these two individuals and all the citizens of this land.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"The plaza falls silent at once.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"It's unanimously understood among Imperials that the Empress and the Empress alone is ordained to rule.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Hence, there's understandable unease at the statement that Empress Hisui wishes to build a new country “alongside the common people.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The Republic has a system of government known as\n'democracy,' wherein each and every citizen may participate in the governance of their country.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“With our newfound independence, I am resolved to introduce this exemplary model of governance to this Empire as well.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“However, I am in no position to change the institutions of this country's government with my meager power alone.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“As such, I intend to make full use of Elsa-sama's thorough knowledge of Republican governance by appointing her as my political advisor.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Naturally, an uneasy commotion begins to stir among the audience.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"After all, Empress Hisui just declared her intention to implement democracy and appointed a Republican as her political advisor.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Indeed, our country did suffer terribly from the war three years ago.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But the time has come to not only heal these wounds of old, but to build a more perfect Empire that we may proudly bequeath to future generations.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Let today mark the day that the Empire belongs to a single Empress no longer, but rather, to each and every Imperial citizen.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“May we all join together, hand in hand, and lead the Empire toward a brighter future.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"A large round of applause rings out starting from the Republican soldiers in the audience.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"But it eventually spreads to the Imperials as well.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"It's fine if the Imperial people need a slight push on the back at first.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Given enough time, they'll eventually grow accustomed to this new form of governance.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I can't believe she just went and made me her political advisor. She could have given me a heads-up first...”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Half sitting and half lying down on the couch in her office, Elsa lets out a sigh.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Isn't this another step closer to realizing your dream?”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I was intending on a much more gradual democratization process.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But Empress Hisui had to go and flat-out deny her right to rule, right before appointing a Republican as her political advisor. It's only going to make the people anxious.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I swear, that girl sure does love rocking the boat.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"“Let today mark the day that the Empire belongs to a single Empress no longer.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"That declaration by Kanami will go down in the annals of Imperial history.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Thus and so, the Empress repudiated the sworn duty bestowed upon the Imperial Family by Oomikami Himself.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"You could say there's no longer even any point for Akari to assert her claim to the throne.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Plans are already underway for democratic elections to be held across the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"The former occupying Republican forces overseeing the election process will administer the government in the interim.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Of course, Elsa has full command over the Republican Army, which makes her the de facto leader of the country.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well, she can't take it back at this point, so I guess what's done is done.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The people's animosity for the Republican Army still runs deep. I'll definitely need the warriors' help.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Akari is already working alongside the Sworn Blades and Elsa in order to address this exact problem.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"In that case, I'll have to do everything I can as well.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course. If there's anything I can do for you, just say the word.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm counting on you.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What did the Republic end up saying about this whole incident?”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well, in terms of the coup d'etat, I think it'll end with Warren taking the fall for everything.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Warren has already been repatriated back to the Republic for his war crimes of indiscriminately bombing civilians.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"In addition, a mass withdrawal of Republican officers like Rochel, and soldiers who have pledged loyalty to the Republic, is scheduled for the coming days.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“From the mainland's point of view, they probably just want to sweep this whole affair under the rug as peacefully as possible.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The presidential election is coming up, so everyone's keen to avoid any more bad press.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is that how it works?”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"I don't know much about how they do things in the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As for me, well, I'll probably end up as the Republican ambassador to the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They're still intent on treating you as a Republican, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well, that's a small compromise to have to make.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The Imperials made the decision to move toward democracy on their own initiative, and they have all the means necessary to achieve it.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As such, we ought to respect their right to self-determination and grant them independence, provided they remain on good relations with the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's how I plan on framing this whole thing, at any rate.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Whether you're starting a war or putting a stop to one, you can't do it without a good reason.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You mean if the situation ever changes, it wouldn't be hard to drum up some new excuse to go to war with us?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's just how the world works.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Elsa shows me a resigned, world-weary smile.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But no matter how deep I get dragged into the muck of the real world, I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" hold on to my last and final modicum of virtue.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's the fealty I swore to myself.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"From now on, Elsa will only have to bear more and more responsibilities.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"She'll be carrying the weight of an entire country on her shoulders, forced to face those who revile her with a smile all while unfalteringly acting in their best interests.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"If anyone can do it, it's her.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"But if possible, I'd like to be by her side to support her.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Do you have reservations about me governing the Empire?”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari has given you her approval, so you have mine as well.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm asking you for your personal opinion here.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm very much looking forward to seeing the country that\nyou'll manage to build.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And if you'd allow it, I want to be by your side to support you.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hmm, whatever could you mean by that? There's a lot of ways I could misunderstand that, you know.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There's nothing to misunderstand.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you're ever in need, I'll be there for you. That's all there is to it.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Though honestly, I'm not good for much besides fighting.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll have you know I'm trying to build a country the peaceful way.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I suppose there won't be anything for me to do then.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Perhaps I should start studying politics.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Though truth be told, scholarship was never my strong suit.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Even if I do start studying, it'll be a very long time before I manage to be useful to her.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm, let's see... A way I can be useful to you right now... I could make you some tea?”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, that would be lovely.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I never thought the day would come when I'd get to drink your tea.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Neither did I.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"The two of us share a comfortable smile.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hehehee, this reminds me of that time we first drank tea together in the student council office.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"That was the day we vowed to overthrow Okonogi together.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"But in the end, rather than collaborating as equals, the two of us were both plotting how best to stab each other in the back.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Though as it turned out, we were both fully intending to betray the other. Aren't we just the worst?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Aahhh... I really did think I was going to be able to take down the warriors at first.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And at the same time, we thought we could be one step ahead of you.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What do you call this in the Empire? A weasel and a tanuki in a battle of wits?”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hahaha, it's a fox and a tanuki.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Still, everything ended up going according to the original plan somehow.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Things sure work out in the strangest of ways.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"I pour two cups of tea and hand one to Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"She slowly takes a sip, pensively swirling her cup as though reflecting on a distant memory.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Back while Yogarasu District was being bombed, what would have happened if I never ended up calling you?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"If I hadn't noticed her phone call, I never would have gone to Yogarasu District.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"I wouldn't have joined forces with Elsa, and we wouldn't have stormed the Government-General together.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"If we hadn't arrested Warren, the Sworn Blades would have all perished in the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"That single phone call undoubtedly changed the fate of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you having regrets about calling me back then?”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Of course not.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What about you? Do you have any regrets about working with me?”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, I'm glad that I did.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I live my life in such a way as to never leave any regrets behind.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Of course. That's what makes you a warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Elsa replies with a warm, contented smile.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Fwaahhh...”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"She covers her hand with her mouth as she lets out a deep yawn.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Sorry. That wonderful tea of yours really wound me down...”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"Elsa's eyes flutter shut as she leans back into the couch.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You deserve a little rest.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Mmh, I think I'll take you up on that...”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Elsa turns and lies down across the couch.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tokita-kun?”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...Will you stay by my side?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"She murmurs in a voice barely above a whisper.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course. You can sleep easy.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's not what I meant...”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Come a bit closer.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"I sit down right next to Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Only then does Elsa finally shut her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thank you for saving me when Warren pulled his gun.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Where did that come from?”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Back then... I never did... thank you properly...”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Her last few words trail off into a gentle sigh.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"She's fallen asleep.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"I find myself unable to take my eyes off her.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Her face looks so much more innocent compared to when\nshe's awake.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Her remarkably long eyelashes flutter slightly whenever she exhales.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"I've heard that Republicans have less skin pigmentation compared to Imperials.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"And indeed, her skin is like an endless expanse of fresh snow.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"I wonder what it must feel like to the touch?",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"I'm unable to stop myself from reaching out.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"I start by running a hand through her beautiful blonde hair.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Those sheer strands of silk and satin slide smoothly between my fingers.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"I proceed to stroke her indescribably soft cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"I run a finger down their length, lightly tracing over the contours of her cheekbones.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"My fingertip finds itself at the corner of her glossy, cherry-red lips...",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"...Even more than her skin, her lips are luscious and ever so slightly damp to the touch.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Nnmm...”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Elsa's eyelids flutter open ever so slightly.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"I pull my hand back in a panic.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry... Did I wake you?”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"I should be ashamed of myself.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"I can't believe I took advantage of her sleeping to touch her up and down.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I don't mind... Ehehee... Keep petting me just like that...”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"She croons in an impossibly sweet voice.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Does she realize what she's even saying?",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Not about to pass up the opportunity, though, I resume stroking her cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Nnm...”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"In response to my touch, the edges of her lips curl up as she narrows her eyes like a cat.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"She languidly reaches up and lays her hand over mine.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You know, Tokita-kun.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“When you told me you'd always be there for me, it made me really happy...”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Didn't we agree I wouldn't be able do anything for you, though?”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Fighting aside, there's another role I have in mind for you.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I want you to always stay by my side... as my ≪partner...≫”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa...”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Elsa's ultramarine eyes stare right into my soul.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Her cheeks slowly take on a vivid blush.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...What does ≪partner≫ mean?”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“My lover! My spouse!”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“O-Ohh, I get it now.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why'd you have to switch to Republican for the most important part?”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I-It's cause it's embarrassing, okay?! Get a clue!”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"She turns away in a huff, her face red as a beet.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"So... Elsa wants me to be her spouse, huh?",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"I wouldn't mind in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"Rather, it'd be an honor to be able to support her in that way.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But you know, I'm still a warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's perfectly fine by me.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You know, I'd hated warriors this whole time, but meeting you was what changed my mind.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I don't know when it was, but I eventually started looking up to the way you would always face forward without any hesitation.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I couldn't stop thinking about how wonderful it'd be if I could be that honest with my feelings, too.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I mean, if you really think about it, it's all because of you that I turned on the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You made me into the person I am today.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"Elsa sits herself upright.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"Her wavering eyes peer anxiously into my own.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“No, I shouldn't be trying to justify myself.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...I just want you to always be there for me.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What do you say?”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Elsa sidles right up next to me.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"My heart is already decided.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"I'll have to ask Akari for her forgiveness rather than her permission.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's not like you... to hesitate so much.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm not hesitating anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
