			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Fweeh?!”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Seeing the intensity in my stare, Elsa lets out a high-pitched squeal.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm not the best with my words, so if I don't say things as they come to me, I have trouble saying them at all.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't forget. We're gonna be together for the rest of our lives.”",
